{"src":"en","tgt":"it","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"it","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7875.744889,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":9079.611391,"text":"Se hai guardato il film National Treasure, potresti pensare che una mappa del tesoro fosse stata scritta sul retro della Dichiarazione d'Indipendenza."},{"kind":"audio","t":9200.219384,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9205.996288,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":9211.354259,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9216.847367999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9222.11966,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9227.592429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9230.311474,"samples":21792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":13885.612018,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":14797.529727,"text":"La cioccolata calda è all'altezza degli standard belgi. I succhi di frutta sono costosi, ma dopo un po' riuscirai a sentirne la dolcezza."},{"kind":"audio","t":14904.538846999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14909.423895999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14913.793453,"samples":28664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":660},{"kind":"audio","t":14992.029482,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14997.056247999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15002.540357,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15005.837682,"samples":25896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":22221.305705000002,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":23037.262031000002,"text":"Tuttavia, non è vero. Sebbene ci sia qualcosa di scritto sul retro del documento, non è una mappa del tesoro."},{"kind":"audio","t":23141.971099000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23144.244781,"samples":18232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":310},{"kind":"audio","t":23232.422614000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23237.525449,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23242.534156,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23247.955586,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":23248.258721000002,"samples":2728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":29989.741439,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":31037.450159,"text":"Potresti voler consultare anche i consigli di governi diversi dal tuo, ma i loro consigli sono pensati per i propri cittadini."},{"kind":"audio","t":31151.870316,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31153.251233000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31154.761917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31156.302342000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31157.909485,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31158.891489,"samples":27560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":41296.932482,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":42492.894786,"text":"L'isola di Hong Kong dà il nome al territorio di Hong Kong ed è un luogo che molti turisti considerano come l'attrazione principale."},{"kind":"audio","t":42611.174608,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42616.513939,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42621.87368,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42627.225691,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42632.70607,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42637.923293,"samples":31760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":49141.555347999994,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":50293.967807,"text":"Chiunque debba guidare a latitudini calde o superare passi montani dovrebbe considerare la possibilità di neve, ghiaccio o gelo."},{"kind":"audio","t":50408.482231999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50413.854392,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":50419.094905,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":50424.369967,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50429.736207999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50434.270232999996,"samples":31160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":59040.986971,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":59986.437591999995,"text":"La segregazione e la ricombinazione rimescolano la variazione avanti e indietro tra i due pool."},{"kind":"audio","t":60092.514798,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60093.998453,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60095.460759,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":60097.324728,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60097.757140999995,"samples":17728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":61184.58072,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":61426.86223,"text":"con ogni generazione."},{"kind":"audio","t":61519.352590999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61521.79546,"samples":20032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":66513.786473,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":67404.999147,"text":"Il termine \"bug\" è usato dagli entomologi in senso formale per questo gruppo di insetti."},{"kind":"audio","t":67619.179914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":67624.48312599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67629.921305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67635.708099,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":67636.009684,"samples":5728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":74701.74803799999,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":75950.292687,"text":"In primo luogo, la maggior parte dei cavalieri indossa stivali da equitazione con il tacco e una suola liscia e piuttosto stretta."},{"kind":"audio","t":76062.877634,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76067.686004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76070.93484999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76074.187386,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76077.451972,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76080.175276,"samples":29960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":83910.904884,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":84821.079322,"text":"La commissione è stata la risposta di Martelli alle diffuse proteste anti-regime iniziate a ottobre."},{"kind":"audio","t":84925.087472,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84930.5793,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84935.945161,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84941.45287,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":84944.896242,"samples":24928,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":91134.438433,"text":"Fire rescue crews eventually doused the fire by 11.35pm."},{"kind":"text","t":92002.230006,"text":"Le squadre di soccorso hanno infine spento l'incendio verso le 23:35."},{"kind":"audio","t":92101.649622,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92107.104381,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92112.422933,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92117.464739,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":860},{"kind":"audio","t":92117.608697,"samples":1528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":97372.24188,"text":"The tensioning storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":98451.40353699999,"text":"La tempesta che ha accentuato la tensione della stagione degli uragani dell'Atlantico, la tempesta subtropicale Jerry,"},{"kind":"audio","t":98561.352068,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98566.532402,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98572.15409899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98576.956399,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":98582.257381,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98584.028331,"samples":17360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":100228.189669,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":100818.118005,"text":"si è formata oggi nell'Oceano Atlantico."},{"kind":"audio","t":100918.35165699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100923.494412,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":100923.879015,"samples":10064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":107242.194053,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":107929.554319,"text":"Ci ha portato ad addestrare l'auto e molti altri dispositivi di trasporto."},{"kind":"audio","t":108037.458243,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108042.833214,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":108047.985288,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108050.544966,"samples":21696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":116620.519095,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":117659.948783,"text":"È rinomata per essere un epicentro del lusso iniziato intorno al 400 d.C. e durato fino a"},{"kind":"audio","t":117770.706901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117776.117151,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117781.416293,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117786.842882,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117789.117764,"samples":20128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":120746.078912,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121336.169665,"text":"fino al 1100 d.C. circa."},{"kind":"audio","t":121440.630758,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121445.495817,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":121445.802922,"samples":1664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":127070.708555,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":127663.567453,"text":"La superficie della luna è fatta di rocce e polvere. Lo strato esterno della luna si chiama crosta."},{"kind":"audio","t":127769.235225,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127770.799569,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127771.880161,"samples":23264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"audio","t":127848.027604,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127849.535069,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127849.895393,"samples":13664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":134215.085171,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":135259.016634,"text":"Il Corpo degli Ingegneri degli Stati Uniti ha stimato che sei pollici di pioggia potrebbero rompere quanto precedentemente danneggiato"},{"kind":"audio","t":135364.590988,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135366.03678400003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135367.58248800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135369.08645300003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135370.712486,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135371.95083500003,"samples":31160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":141189.502364,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":142169.894815,"text":"In particolare, si sostiene che sia possibile capire se una persona stia mentendo interpretando correttamente le microespressioni."},{"kind":"audio","t":142279.24926500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142280.89836800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142282.288745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142283.87277800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142285.431772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142286.617273,"samples":30560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":147235.858447,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":147957.426183,"text":"Non deturpare il sito scrivendo o incidendo graffiti sulla struttura."},{"kind":"audio","t":148078.032997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148079.40727400003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148081.111485,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148081.49360900003,"samples":15096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":155261.959574,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":156623.653561,"text":"Il ruggito della tigre non è come quello a piena voce di un leone, ma somiglia di più a una sequenza di parole ringhiate e gridate."},{"kind":"audio","t":156739.009632,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156740.367609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156741.90365400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156743.46829800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156745.077821,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156745.886468,"samples":25760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"input","t":161914.816767,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":162828.412409,"text":"Le ricerche del XX secolo hanno dimostrato che esistono due pool di variazione genetica, nascosto ed espresso."},{"kind":"audio","t":162944.96498000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162950.38237900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162955.623242,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162961.007423,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":162966.32635400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162967.714111,"samples":14960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"close","t":173105.61255700001,"code":1005}]}